+dependencies and record a fresh RED baseline before changing code.
+
+## Plan review gate
+
+Before `/dev`, security/product review must confirm:
+
+1. Conversation membership is the sole MVP group authority for meetings.
+2. Legacy `team`/`public` meetings become owner-only until explicitly shared.
+3. Unknown participant labels never auto-grant access.
+4. Restricted proposal acceptance preserves scope; org publication is explicit
+   admin declassification.
+5. Raw transcript search remains out of the first omnipresent-chat slice.
+6. Unresolved legacy derivatives are quarantined rather than defaulted to org.
+7. The task order in `tasks.md` is accepted, including real-database negative
+   tests before rollout.
+
+Approval authorizes `/dev` only. It does not authorize shipping, provider work,
+or a pull request.
