+## `/dev` stop conditions
+
+Stop and return to plan review if implementation would require any of the
+following:
+
+- trusting provider identities or participant labels for membership;
+- making legacy `team`/`public` tenant-visible;
+- allowing missing provenance to fall back to org or owner guessing;
+- adding raw transcript search to the first chat slice;
+- changing collaboration roles/semantics beyond reader/writer/admin;
+- introducing a policy engine, new identity provider, or cross-tenant sharing;
+- publishing a restricted derivative without explicit admin declassification;
+- weakening tests, migrations, tenant constraints, denial uniformity, or audit
+  redaction.
+
+## Handoff to `/dev`
+
+Start only after the seven plan-review decisions in `plan.md` are approved.
+Install locked dependencies in this isolated worktree, reproduce the recorded
+baseline, then begin Task 1. Do not open a PR from PLAN stage.
